ine.java\n#\tsrc/main/java/Event.java\n#\tsrc/main/java/Jason.java\n#\tsrc/main/java/Task.java\n","tags":["Level-7"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"9f376e49dd05a31d8a71a5056e0b106afbf9b91c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add date time parsing","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":140,"deletions":37}}},{"hash":"6e5d4a5cf5a53df25013842a486b4db6f87f8983","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-level-8\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-8"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"857d2a5591e662f9d551062f6a600638b3253338","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update skills for Codex","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":95,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"4e4b3a1eeb4087e903e951859bc6a8aeb076cde2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract command-line interaction into Ui","messageBody":"Move console input, welcome/goodbye messages, errors, and task feedback out of Main and Input into a dedicated Ui class. Keep Input\u0027s legacy constructor and preserve the existing user-visible behavior while establishing the first separation of responsibilities for the Jason refactoring.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":81,"deletions":20}}},{"hash":"c15d47ec42e93a4343ce383c3af613cdbae02d80","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract task persistence into Storage","messageBody":"Move task-file loading, saving, serialization, date-time parsing, and persistence error handling from Jason into a dedicated Storage class. Let Jason coordinate task mutations while Storage owns the file format and TaskList accept loaded tasks during construction. Preserve the existing save path and command-line behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":132,"deletions":112}}},{"hash":"a869cea8c533fe78a2e6a1f29e4ffb693791810f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract command parsing into Parser","messageBody":"Move command-type detection, task-index parsing, and todo/deadline/event construction out of Input and into a dedicated Parser class. Keep Input focused on executing parsed commands and delegating user-facing output to Ui, while preserving existing command behavior and compatibility.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":95,"deletions":84}}},{"hash":"6b8f7f18fe782cb6948f0e162f6e3324b5204944","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move application loop into Jason","messageBody":"Make Jason the application coordinator by moving the UI lifecycle, command-reading loop, and error recovery into a public run method. Reduce Main to the minimal entry point that constructs Jason and starts it, completing the current separation among Ui, Storage, Parser, TaskList, and the application controller.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":30,"deletions":21}}},{"hash":"705866c8964d4ea1f194b918efd939b451896a7b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Introduce executable command hierarchy","messageBody":"Replace Input\u0027s command execution path with an abstract Command and concrete add, list, mark, unmark, delete, and exit commands. Make Parser return executable commands, have Jason run the target-style parse/execute loop, and show divider lines around each interaction. Update the UI test plan for the intentional console output change.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":127,"deletions":8},"md":{"insertions":2,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"5efe968f84cf9d4dcae2add1429516ee6ea1c2aa","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove obsolete Input command classes","messageBody":"Make Parser dispatch directly to concrete Command implementations, replacing the now-unneeded CommandType intermediary. Delete Input and CommandType after confirming no source references remain, completing the command-hierarchy cleanup without changing the user-facing behavior.\n","tags":["A-MoreOOP"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":12,"deletions":110}}},{"hash":"5b2276a79cc4ac57ec4bd3295fbc356f9d08aa33","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Organize classes into Java packages","messageBody":"Keep src/main/java as the source root while grouping application classes under jason, commands under jason.command, task models under jason.task, persistence under jason.storage, UI under jason.ui, and custom exceptions under jason.exception. Update imports and the UI test plan to launch the packaged jason.Main entry point.\n","tags":["A-Packages"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":111,"deletions":1},"md":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"140cfe8bb29c5fbe5aa6eb90f19a12786b08cdbf","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AGENTS.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":11,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"9e85f9d970f8d91318caec8da81ee4eb73b56bd9","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027add-gradle-support\u0027","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Gradle"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"0be1a8e6d18b05c455d5c3e0e29a01b65c7da91b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Implement testing for Parser, Tasklist and Storage","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":340,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"25589c7752fce054b3375457d5b6eedacbc72bd2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Include unit testing for non-trivial public methods","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":368,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"8f0c1271eb98407e81a6b4b2f34061d424069f60","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update build.gradle to build jason.jar","messageBody":"","tags":["A-Jar"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"554852a53e59ace878c6d86a973265a6d35b0052","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add JavaDoc headers to non-private classes and methods","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":67,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"f93423b18a4b8f4d435ae0ce5ab58bd58b49efd2","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027b